  combinedLines: Behind him, the shadow of a man was watching the boy closely from
    beginning to end. In this ruined world where piles of dead bodies were ignored,
    the girl's presence looked like a small spark of warmth in the eyes of the man,
    sneaking through a bloody world. | Without thinking, the man walked closer to
    the girl.
